OL,3,AIndependent review announced into
OL,4,Amurder of student Henry Nowak
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the teenager's murder, police
OL,7,Fbodycam footage of him being handcuffed
OL,8,Fas he lay dying led to intense scrutiny
OL,9,Fof the Hampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,10,FConstabulary and sparked wider debates
OL,11,Faround knife laws, race, policing and
OL,12,Fpublic trust.
OL,14,FThe review, which was welcomed by
OL,15,FNowak's family, will be led by former
OL,16,FJustice Secretary Alex Chalk KC.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
