OL,3,AStorm Boelo leaves 22,000 without power
OL,4,Aas Met Office issues new wind warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clean-up operation is under way in
OL,7,Fparts of the UK after Storm Boelo
OL,8,Fcaused flooding and property damage,
OL,9,Fleaving thousands without power.
OL,11,FThe Energy Networks Association (ENA)
OL,12,Fsaid around 22,600 properties are still
OL,13,Fwithout power as of Monday afternoon.
OL,15,FTwo men were killed by falling trees
OL,16,Fduring the storm on Sunday - a man in
OL,17,Fhis 20s whose car was hit in north
OL,18,FLondon and a 60-year-old man in
OL,19,FDumfries and Galloway identified as
OL,20,FRichard Baines, the long-serving
OL,21,Fcurator of Logan Botanic Garden.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
