OL,3,ACelebrations in Serbia after veteran
OL,4,Aruler VuDMiDG loses election to
OL,5,Astudent-led protest movement
OL,6,
OL,7,FSerbia's long-standing leader
OL,8,FAleksandar VuDMiDG has admitted defeat
OL,9,Fto a student-led protest movement in
OL,10,Fsnap parliamentary elections.
OL,12,FCelebrations erupted as crowds
OL,13,Fdescended on the centre of Belgrade,
OL,14,FNovi Sad and other cities.
OL,16,FThe student movement was formed less
OL,17,Fthan two years ago in response to a
OL,18,Frailway station disaster blamed on
OL,19,Fcorruption and negligence, but fought
OL,20,Fthe election with candidates from a
OL,21,Fcross-section of Serbian society.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
